mujoco-stubs

An unofficial, independently maintained package of type declarations for MuJoCo.
Project-specific additions and modifications: Copyright 2026 Xiaoyan Wang.

The declarations and included documentation were generated from MuJoCo 3.4.0
using pybind11-stubgen and subsequently corrected by hand. The original
pybind11-stubgen version and command-line options were not recorded.

